                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "enchanted_state",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "In the fairy tale, the <w>bewitched</w> forest was full of talking animals and moving trees.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "fr": "Dans le conte de fées, la forêt <w>ensorcelée</w> regorgeait d'animaux qui parlaient et d'arbres qui bougeaient.",
                                "zh": "在童话故事里，那座<w>中了魔法的</w>森林里到处是会说话的动物和移动的树木。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The villagers believed that the old castle was <w>bewitched</w> and avoided going near it.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "fr": "Les villageois croyaient que le vieux château était <w>ensorcelé</w> et évitaient de s'en approcher.",
                                "zh": "村民们认为那座古堡<w>着了魔</w>，不敢靠近它。"
                            }
                        }
